t, organisiert er einen Familien-Trip nach London – und bringt damit alle ins Visier eines unerwarteten Feindes.","poster":"/ltT51ctLDbelHmamsAxqPyU1JY.jpg","runtime":106.0,"title":"The Family Plan 2","type":"movie","va":6.6,"vc":691,"year":"2025"},"movie:1456302":{"cast":[{"id":1634719,"name":"Paul Hollingsworth","photo":""},{"id":1377399,"name":"Chris Osborn","photo":"/xohyoSKpTZvAwFbK7bHyApCDaSY.jpg"},{"id":1848433,"name":"Jordan Johnson","photo":""},{"id":1634722,"name":"Gopal Bidari","photo":""},{"id":5336365,"name":"Crystalyn Falk Corso","photo":""}],"genres":["Familie","Abenteuer","Animation","Komödie"],"id":1456302,"original":"The Lego Ghostbusters Movie","overview":"","poster":"/laWrppUpxPc065hiItbWAOVxY63.jpg","runtime":5.0,"title":"The Lego Ghostbusters Movie","type":"movie","va":0.0,"vc":0,"year":"2016"},"movie:1476740":{"cast":[{"id":2458589,"name":"Cassandra Naud","photo":"/Fw2FlUQGmFC0DGLGEBATXfswHh.jpg"},{"id":59181,"name":"Emily Tennant","photo":"/feZDxU3OB9rJjqH3g7a3zH88mkG.jpg"},{"id":1335315,"name":"Georgina Campbell","photo":"/kgXHKjI728Nv7FLVf38S9QzHU2n.jpg"},{"id":4980097,"name":"Lisa Delamar","photo":"/bHHKsBKT4DT9u9F846v61PNHgcW.jpg"},{"id":1518194,"name":"Jonathan Whitesell","photo":"/aU1Tsj7PW4DPJf47CCNZLAkDlKP.jpg"},{"id":2015400,"name":"Veronica Long","photo":"/ytrg4NdduyNDqkwPoewYvWfcvpy.jpg"},{"id":1098664,"name":"Dylan Playfair","photo":"/iWkup8QYwyEYM4Dvi7x1OHHNR6G.jpg"},{"id":101016,"name":"Osric Chau","photo":"/jqbRL2eNTxm4ut72dJGqlGZd6yW.jpg"}],"genres":["Horror","Thriller"],"id":1476740,"original":"Influencers","overview":"Die clevere CW macht mit ihrer Freundin Diane in deren Heimat Südfrankreich Ferien. Dort will das junge Paar den ersten Jahrestag seiner Beziehung feiern. Leider werden sie aber ausgerechnet bei dieser Gelegenheit von der Hotelführung aus ihrer Suite hinauskomplimentiert und in ein deutlich kleineres Gästezimmer umquartiert – was CW vor Wut schäumen lässt. Noch angeschlagener ist ihr Ego, als sie den Grund für den Verlust ihres glamourösen Liebesnestes erfährt: Die Direktion wollte sie nämlich aus der Luxusbleibe heraushaben, um dort eine populärere britische Influencerin unterbringen zu können, von der sie sich positive Publicity verspricht. Doch damit nicht genug. Diese Charlotte scheint sich obendrein auch noch recht schamlos an Diane heranmachen zu wollen. CW findet das natürlich überhaupt nicht witzig und beschließt, dem dreisten Treiben ein Ende zu setzen…","poster":"/nFx8JqrzQRkNCqTDSv8ybOgJmb6.jpg","runtime":110.0,"title":"Influencer 2","type":"movie","va":6.2,"vc":148,"year":"2025"},"movie:1651613":{"cast":[{"id":6070256,"name":"Angelo Rosario","photo":"/x3YYGcjPneyvObxNeDMqxme68Bi.jpg"},{"id":5128190,"name":"Grace Berry","photo":"/fv2Gp0ViPAlSSVxM8KsNiFCEs91.jpg"},{"id":4960988,"name":"Jeffrey Poyo","photo":"/lkzrS3ye15OD8TYeTbXhDlHKsCz.jpg"},{"id":1768212,"name":"Drew Russell","photo":"/AtfHXUV9lBckZXwGPiH2I2JyDxv.jpg"},{"id":5417924,"name":"Kyle Painter","photo":"/38WB6zg7vuab1iQ7IdPMOeWABtK.jpg"},{"id":3102357,"name":"Kaylie Heyner","photo":"/voqG3qg8FeWbut6kOFv1u8kqmHA.jpg"},{"id":2761568,"name":"Patrick Logan","photo":"/gDUxtZ2NQIDPE9RSVwe91DzUPxg.jpg"},{"id":5044581,"name":"Adam Bash","photo":"/gVfk594UocPteXxMqRX6S5LXcPX.jpg"}],"genres":["Liebesfilm"],"id":1651613,"original":"Before Me","overview":"","poster":"/zoGsaZoIzGrhUkznTwzTdOVVG68.jpg","runtime":112.0,"title":"Before Me","type":"movie","va":0.0,"vc":0,"year":"2026"},"movie:1706711":{"cast":[{"id":2892320,"name":"Rafael Fiziev","photo":"/7x8cDGiETH2vwZob3m2WChIQguw.jpg"},{"id":3545981,"name":"Manuel Torres","photo":"/teQpLtGvDMmDM2XPOzeX6bIyjK.jpg"},{"id":4301870,"name":"Shara Magomedov","photo":"/wICXcBIwxEXRRF0eBNPS4PqITBY.jpg"},{"id":2525028,"name":"Michel Pereira","photo":"/2csJBKspwJMpixwT0GeQWsDYhUs.jpg"},{"id":5432950,"name":"Matheus Camilo","photo":""},{"id":3942411,"name":"Nazim Sadykhov","photo":""},{"id":4191457,"name":"Asu Almabayev","photo":""},{"id":3629189,"name":"Charles Johnson","p